pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: 结束语控制在 20 秒：三句话收束——证据、风控、进化。联系方式全部留占位符，现场手填或后续补充。
elements:
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [90, 160, 90, 2]
    viewBox: [90, 2]
    points: "0,1 90,1"
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: hero-en
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 184, 800, 46]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Build Evidence. Control Risk. Compound Intelligence.</p>
  - elementId: hero-cn
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 244, 800, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$muted"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>用证据建立信任，用风控保护资本，用系统实现长期进化。</p>
  - elementId: contact
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 360, 500, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        <p>创始人：【待补充】</p>
        <p>电话：【待补充】　邮箱：【待补充】</p>
        <p>公司：【待补充】</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 505, 780, 16]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: "QuantOS · 2026-07 · Confidential · 历史模拟结果不代表未来表现 · 19"}
